{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：中国硬件，苹果六月季度电话会与智能手机出货更新</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">苹果六月季度财报电话会释放的信息，比营收数字本身更值得产业链关注。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在最新中国硬件研究报告中梳理了三个相互关联的事实：iPhone在六月季度实现<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>的同比增长，但苹果同时提示SoC供应约束将在九月季度显著增加，且供应链弹性有限；中国智能手机市场上半年出货量同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>，但部分品牌在1H26出现了明显的渠道补库存；iPhone 18系列下半年备货计划从先前预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8400万</span>部<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">下修</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8100万</span>部，其中折叠机型占<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">750万</span>部。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告的核心判断是：智能手机供应链公司的报价表现将取决于2Q26/1H26业绩与2H26展望，部分上半年业绩可能因补库存而好于预期，但下半年不确定性会随市场双位数下滑而增加。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">换句话说</span>，上半年报表的\"安全垫\"来自渠道库存行为，而非终端需求的真实回暖。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWxibxRDceM8A5R8oYEFUPYnHuyq7WevlkA60WEwrvic1NfSzXvtiaKAhExgO9xob7iaReuQ4OborPTmBtXCmk48IesJxJnPSJUtYQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">月度与季度数据变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">根据中国信通院数据，6月中国智能手机出货量同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.6%</span>，环比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">36%</span>，影响1H26整体出货量同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。作为对比，同期出货量（不含国内市场）同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>。两组数据之间的缺口，正是渠道库存变化的体现。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>指出，国内品牌厂商1H26出货量同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.4%</span>，但2Q26环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18.7%</span>、同比微增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.1%</span>；非国内品牌1H26出货量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.9%</span>，2Q26环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22.7%</span>、同比增长5%。报告认为出货量数据受到供应约束前备货行为的支撑，而补贴效应消退叠加厂商提升平均售价，出货量仍在调整。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 出货量数据（含国内市场）与出货量数据（不含国内市场）之间的差距，是判断这轮\"回暖\"成色的关键。上半年渠道多备的货，下半年若终端消化<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">不及预期</span>，就会反过来压制新机拉货。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXxtn0VpCsiaJQ91fUMWUfP2sHcEDfg96f2ibUUkVjrEibh0YFYLYkoZdRegor825VoIvJLGYJx4HiaROI4FrQt8ibwWd1AiaKNtr8b0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.苹果中国区六月季度业务与季度数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">苹果六月季度中国区收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>认为这主要由iPhone的强劲出货和产品结构驱动。IDC数据显示，2Q26中国智能手机出货量约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6600万</span>部，同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.3%</span>；苹果出货量约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1200万</span>部，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24.4%</span>，市场份额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18.1%</span>，同比提升4.2个百分点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是，苹果的出货量（不含国内市场）在高基数下同比小幅下滑3-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，但市场份额仍达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.9%</span>，同比提升1.7个百分点。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>认为，iPhone的销售动能从4月到6月中旬因高基数而暂停，6月下旬起在促销活动推动下恢复。苹果在财报电话会中表示，iPhone <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>的同比增长主要由iPhone 17系列驱动，其中Pro机型占比更高。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV3HQjzPGLiaxx7hWcFicYkw13OULDPZptOz4FjEKWP2Dl9HhrQ3WullXWIAn2C34iaXVU8q836uGdPh1yYfdUC2qqmrIH89uMa9M/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>最新iPhone生产计划显示，3Q26E产量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>，但2H26E iPhone 18系列备货量从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8400万</span>部<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">下修</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8100万</span>部。其中iPhone 18 Fold产量为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">750万</span>部，富士康为整理版EMS供应商；立讯精密将供应iPhone 18 Pro/Pro Max的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>/41%，和硕/塔塔仅供应Pro Max的7%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">iPhone 18的关键升级集中在两个方向：折叠机型带来。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUydF9u9tY2Txqma5lpNLibG8YG89g10Z59qdtI8HX8chSC0MZcrkwq8ibEXWlJiaib1iakTcH9DffWTj0vm1AL4JYCGYWWsaPdTSibY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 11-CITI-China Hardware-Read-across from Apple Jun-Q-26 Earnings Call and Update on China Smartphone Shipments-260802</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
